{"evt":"note_created","id":"note-mqgvuijz6kk","workspace":"D:\\zonoid","title":"Blocking-dep context-seed design: prerequisites become low-weight judged decaying context edges, gate-transparent; lives in autowire/ingestNode, NOT suggest_links","summary":"Design (refined with user 2026-06-16) for making a task's blocking-dep history flow as retrieval context — the gap DAG-tier injection (context_deps only, routes/graph.js:153) leaves open. PLACEMENT: suggest_links does NOT write edges — it is a read-only RANKER (suggestForTask daemon.js:1257; daemon.js:1188 'auto-wiring uses the IDENTICAL relevance the agent sees from suggest_links'). Every edge write funnels through ONE primitive: overlayStore.addEdge (dedupes). So the auto-seed belongs in the autowire path / unified ingestNode pipeline (daemon.js ~1416), NOT suggest_links. MECHANISM: for each DIRECT blocking dep D of task A, seed a LOW-WEIGHT context edge D->A via addEdge with {by:'autowire-blockdep', judged:false}; bounded 1-hop (anchored depth) — no transitive blocked-by walk. GATE-TRANSPARENT INVARIANT: a gate stops WORK flowing forward but lets KNOWLEDGE flow through — context-layer ops pass THROUGH gate nodes, never landing on them. ingestNode already skips embed+autowire for gates (daemon.js:1430); the seed honors it from the other direction: if D is kind==='gate', skip it and seed to its blocking deps (skip contiguous gates, bounded transit), so 'A blocked_by gate blocked_by B' collapses to a single B->A context seed — the gate doesn't consume the hop. judged:false routes the edges through the Context Verdict Model (note-mqelk8e5ths, task<->task scope) which keeps relevant deps + prunes operational-only ones; low weight prevents flooding; they decay via the note-decay lane if never recalled-and-helpful. WIRE-CREATION MAP (audited): unified at the WRITE primitive (addEdge) but NOT at the decision layer — ~6 independent callers (autowire/ingestNode, add_dependency, record_decision wires_to, native-blockedBy daemon.js:150/168, followups, /overlay/edge); a future 'wire decision funnel' could consolidate them, parallel to task 28.","created_by":"main","valid_from":"2026-06-16T16:55:01.487Z","vec":[-0.1300322264432907,-0.0013776894193142653,-0.00463227229192853,0.01549217663705349,0.0754021480679512,-0.09200173616409302,0.026630984619259834,0.004686941392719746,-0.0010945552494376898,0.03174743056297302,-0.018054543063044548,0.016556525602936745,0.011732250452041626,-0.04049897566437721,-0.017871830612421036,0.056437261402606964,0.09144066274166107,-0.006313481833785772,-0.02115340158343315,-0.11163384467363358,0.06224752590060234,-0.00798665452748537,0.015397953800857067,-0.02675817161798477,-0.02042928896844387,-0.029959218576550484,-0.07159612327814102,0.025641299784183502,0.029456239193677902,-0.06745196878910065,-0.004220565315335989,0.05639086663722992,-0.1135074570775032,0.017063328996300697,-0.07183459401130676,0.07909098267555237,-0.04981807619333267,-0.0010024193907156587,-0.032345738261938095,-0.07458753138780594,0.032633643597364426,0.11283422261476517,-0.039096467196941376,-0.0036035070661455393,-0.04272686690092087,-0.01421416737139225,-0.13670136034488678,0.020053280517458916,-0.0822206512093544,-0.05609092488884926,-0.048142869025468826,0.03190815448760986,0.050320256501436234,0.036377668380737305,0.07372786849737167,0.024467049166560173,0.043865811079740524,0.023806365206837654,-0.0968656986951828,0.021341050043702126,0.012653506360948086,-0.03040171228349209,-0.08343721181154251,-0.03814740478992462,0.03483771160244942,0.053599271923303604,0.03920864686369896,0.04063080623745918,0.06347458809614182,-0.014067391864955425,0.06268317997455597,-0.02905736118555069,-0.07099060714244843,0.00001924414755194448,0.06930136680603027,0.03582919389009476,-0.00896143727004528,0.05592930689454079,-0.07384653389453888,-0.12429981678724289,-0.030610695481300354,0.05274248123168945,0.035031016916036606,0.010472135618329048,-0.02196134440600872,0.010066631250083447,0.0111592